# (0.18) The Desktop (DESK=1): the Terminal from the Programs menu (Alt+P, T, Enter), "gtest f &"
# in it (a full-screen program), Alt+Esc back to the desktop, "kill" of it in the Terminal: the
# desktop is as it was (tests/pictures/gtestk*.png: the full screen, the desktop after Alt+Esc,
# after the kill).
5000 {dE2}
+100 p
+100 {uE2}
+500 t
+300 \n
+3000 gtest f &\n
+3000 {dE2}
+100 {esc}
+100 {uE2}
+1500 ps\n
+2000 kill 8\n
+1500 ps\n
